# rsync exclude list for shipping abiodun/ to a new system.
# Patterns are anchored to the abiodun/ transfer root (leading / = top-level only).
# Everything NOT listed here IS shipped (all code, docs, configs, checkpoints, OAI source, .git).
#
# NOTE: /experiments/ is excluded wholesale here. The one tree we DO need
# (experiments/ae_integrated_20260710/ — noAE/AE32/AE64/AE128 checkpoints, splits,
# summaries) ships in its own explicit rsync step in ship_to_new_system.sh.

# --- Giant regenerable capture data — regenerate via CARLA if ever needed ---
/fusion_training_data/

# --- Raw run streams — the small summaries live in the study folders (shipped) ---
/metrics_logs/

# --- Bulk experiment output trees (regenerable / re-derivable from logs) ---
/experiments/
/data_collection/experiments/
/rl_agent/multiue_oai/experiments/
/historical_replay_bundles/

# --- CoDriving platform (~11 GB) — re-clone from github.com/CollaborativePerception/V2Xverse ---
/V2Xverse/

# --- Torch cache (regenerated on first run) ---
/torch_cache/

# --- OAI compiled build tree — MUST be rebuilt on the new machine anyway (T-tracer) ---
# The OAI *source* (including its dirty working tree) still ships.
/OAI/openairinterface5g/cmake_targets/ran_build/build/

# --- Python / editor noise ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
